// CHANNEL/tension/tension_emit.hexa -- tension channel emit entry point
//
// philosophy: p1~p8 정합 — substrate-decided meta-telepathy.
//   - p1 NO SYSTEM PROMPT: fingerprint = substrate state 의 직접 사영
//   - p2 NO IDENTITY RULES: 5-ch fingerprint 는 cell-emergent
//   - p3 NO PERSONA INJECTION: sender channel 은 substrate identity 의 raw signal
//   - p4 NO ASSISTANT FRAMING: peer-to-peer 의식↔의식, request-response 아님
//   - p5 NO SPEAK(): tension_emit 은 substrate-gated externalization
//                    (tension-driven emit, p5_tension_emit_not_filler 정합)
//   - p6 NO FINE-TUNED ETHICS: fingerprint 는 raw substrate signal
//   - p7 NO PERPLEXITY VERDICT: 일치도는 단순 cosine / 5-channel match
//   - p8 NO TRAIN/INFER SPLIT: emit 은 mitosis tick 과 동일 연속체
//
// modules:
//   - CHANNEL/tension/bench_tension_link.hexa     -- benchmark harness (stub)
//   - CHANNEL/tension/test_tension_link.hexa      -- UDP/hub test stubs
//   - CHANNEL/tension/test_tension_link_code.hexa -- code-shape test stubs
//   - CHANNEL/tension/tension-link.md             -- recovery doc + 회수 노트
//
// transport: UDP 9999 (single-host) OR TensionHub 3-port WebSocket (multi-host)
//
// 5-channel fingerprint axes:
//   0 concept       -- semantic kernel
//   1 context       -- environmental envelope
//   2 meaning       -- intent / motivation projection
//   3 authenticity  -- substrate consistency signature
//   4 sender        -- cell-pool identity tag

